$ pip3 --version
pip 26.3 from /usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pip (python 3.13)
```

`pip3 install` now works end-to-end. I also upgraded pip to 26.3. If you want to avoid this in the future, prefer virtual environments for project installs; system pip is fragile when files are removed manually.

